## Revenue Model
- Nama: Transaction Fees (Gas Fees) | Status: Live | Deskripsi: Biaya transaksi dibayar dalam APT, sebagian dibakar (burned), sisanya ke validator/staker. Protokol tidak memiliki fee switch ke treasury. | Sources: Aptos Tokenomics Blog, https://aptoslabs.com/aptos-tokenomics (HIGH); Aptos Docs Gas, https://aptos.dev/concepts/gas (HIGH)
- Nama: Validator Staking Rewards (Inflation) | Status: Live | Deskripsi: Reward staking berasal dari emisi inflasi (tokenomics schedule), bukan dari fee protokol. | Sources: Aptos Tokenomics Blog, https://aptoslabs.com/aptos-tokenomics (HIGH)
- Nama: Enterprise / Node Service (Aptos Labs) | Status: Live | Deskripsi: Aptos Labs (entitas komersial) menawarkan layanan infrastruktur, dukungan enterprise, dan consulting (B2B), terpisah dari protokol. | Sources: Aptos Labs Careers/Enterprise, https://aptoslabs.com/careers (MEDIUM); The Block Interview Mo Shaikh, https://www.theblock.co/post/267882/aptos-labs-revenue (MEDIUM)
- Nama: Grant Funding (Foundation) | Status: Live | Deskripsi: Foundation mendistribusikan grant dari treasury token untuk pertumbuhan ekosistem (outflow, bukan revenue). | Sources: Aptos Foundation Grants, https://aptosfoundation.org/grants (HIGH)

