## Fundraising Mechanism
- VC Funding (Series A, Series B) via equity/token warrant agreements (SAFT/Equity).
- Foundation Treasury Allocation (51% Community + 16.5% Foundation Endowment dari Genesis Supply).
- Protocol Revenue: Tidak ada (Fee burned).
- Enterprise Revenue (Aptos Labs): Layanan B2B.
