## Financial Dependencies
- Pihak: Venture Capital Investors (a16z, Multicoin, Tiger Global, dll) | Peran: Modal awal operasi Aptos Labs (Company) hingga Series B. | Sources: Aptos Blog Series A, https://aptoslabs.com/aptos-labs-raises-200-million-series-a (HIGH); Aptos Blog Series B, https://aptoslabs.com/aptos-labs-raises-150-million-series-b (HIGH)
