## RINGKASAN
- Total Funding Raised: $350,000,000 (Series A $200M + Series B $150M) ke Aptos Labs Inc. (Company).
- Funding Rounds: 2 (Series A, Series B).
- Treasury Status: Tidak diungkap (Foundation mengelola alokasi token besar ~67.5% supply, tidak ada dashboard fiat real-time).
- Revenue Sources: Gas Fees (Burned - Protocol), Inflation Staking Rewards (Protocol), Enterprise Services (Aptos Labs Company), Grants Outflow (Foundation).
- Revenue Availability: Protocol Revenue = $0 (Fees burned). Company Revenue = Privat (Tidak diungkap). Foundation = Grant Outflow Only.

